Package: InRelate
Type: Package
Title: InRelate: An R Package to Estimate Pairwise Relatedness
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Khuyen", "Nguyen", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Arun", "Sethuraman", role = "aut")
)
Description: An R software package to estimate genetic relatedness while
    accounting for population structure. This R package utilizes the output
    from MULTICLUST or STRUCTURE for allele frequency data and admixture
    proportion data.
